{"id": "DeMiEoaP-8i", "title": "Video by index.opensource", "description": "Two maps become a mountain flyover.\n\nVoxelSpace samples a height map and a color map, projects heights into screen columns, and paints the terrain with vertical lines. Nearer terrain hides lower, more distant parts; the renderer takes wider steps farther away.\n\nThe result is a camera view of the terrain, useful for exploring retro flight visuals and height-map rendering. Each map position has one height, and lighting is already painted into the color map.\n\nThe original renderer drew these views with our own maps and camera path. We made the explanatory diagrams, separated-column view, and triangle comparison.\n\n\uc9c0\ub3c4 \ub450 \uc7a5\uc73c\ub85c \uc0b0 \uc704\ub97c \ub0a0\uc544\uac11\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nVoxelSpace\ub294 \ub192\uc774 \uc9c0\ub3c4\uc640 \uc0c9 \uc9c0\ub3c4\ub97c \uc77d\uace0, \ub192\uc774\ub97c \ud654\uba74\uc758 \uc138\ub85c\uc904\uc5d0 \ud22c\uc601\ud574 \uc9c0\ud615\uc744 \uadf8\ub824\uc694. \uc55e\ucabd \uc9c0\ud615\uc5d0 \uac00\ub824\uc9c0\ub294 \ubd80\ubd84\uc740 \uac74\ub108\ub6f0\uace0, \uba40\ub9ac \uac08\uc218\ub85d \uc9c0\ub3c4\uc5d0\uc11c \uc77d\ub294 \uc904\uc758 \uac04\uaca9\uc744 \ub113\ud799\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uacb0\uacfc\ub294 \uce74\uba54\ub77c \uc2dc\uc810\uc5d0\uc11c \ubcf8 \uc9c0\ud615 \ud654\uba74\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub808\ud2b8\ub85c \ube44\ud589 \uc7a5\uba74\uc774\ub098 \ub192\uc774 \uc9c0\ub3c4 \ub80c\ub354\ub9c1\uc744 \uc0b4\ud3b4\ubcf4\uae30 \uc88b\uc544\uc694. \uc9c0\ub3c4 \ud55c \uc704\uce58\uc5d0\ub294 \ub192\uc774\uac00 \ud558\ub098\uc529 \uc788\uace0 \ube5b\uacfc \uadf8\ub9bc\uc790\ub294 \uc0c9 \uc9c0\ub3c4\uc5d0 \ubbf8\ub9ac \ub4e4\uc5b4 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc6d0\ubcf8 \ub80c\ub354\ub7ec\uc5d0 \uc9c1\uc811 \ub9cc\ub4e0 \uc9c0\ub3c4\uc640 \uce74\uba54\ub77c \uacbd\ub85c\ub97c \ub123\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc124\uba85 \uadf8\ub9bc, \ubc8c\ub9b0 \uc138\ub85c\uc904 \ud654\uba74, \uc0bc\uac01\ud615 \ube44\uad50 \uadf8\ub9bc\uc740 \ubcc4\ub3c4\ub85c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5c8\uc5b4\uc694.\n\nVoxelSpace by Sebastian Macke \u00b7 MIT (code)\nhttps://github.com/s-macke/VoxelSpace\nTerrain maps & explanatory visuals: index.opensource\n\uc9c1\uc811 \ub9cc\ub4e0 \uc9c0\ub3c4\ub97c \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc800\uc7a5\uc18c\uc758 \uac8c\uc784 \uc9c0\ub3c4\ub294 MIT \ub300\uc0c1\uc774 \uc544\ub2c8\uba70 \uc774 \uc601\uc0c1\uc5d0 \uc4f0\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc558\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n#opensource #VoxelSpace #creativecoding #computergraphics", "channel": "index.opensource", "uploader_id": "60040254965", "uploader": "index.opensource", "timestamp": 1791381941, "like_count": 4733, "comment_count": 47, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1481700197159751a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 53.266, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNSb_9UptfpV3VM0DPzDUeaopQl70HeaAfL7yNsU_YeDb8nwYUTMrZVw6DAtmMYUFNXXku56TOhlO7TYVQgPFbdU_ltTJJt7t6xfVw.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=v5bIZT81k0kQ7kNvwGndZlg&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=hn5fH5YIbp2wC3V4a-xOAA&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQMPfatIpy-yfC4VGwqL8m4TZO-hjUmgUGQ2Pxa_B-TMbg&oe=6AE2264F", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 53.266, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": null, "filesize_approx": null, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0;