text": "Best game ever", "timestamp": 1792406417, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "stammtischhistoriker", "author_id": "2038207622", "id": "17913599889284009", "text": "I played Comanche back then, and it looked like shit. it was several years too early with the Voxel concept, and basically an interesting (und underwhelming) tech demo.", "timestamp": 1792309527, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "seebeyondthelines", "author_id": "770009578", "id": "18273021688307105", "text": "Comanche was soooo much fun", "timestamp": 1792259956, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "igot1forya", "author_id": "231956276", "id": "18169254349477980", "text": "Reminds me of VistaPro", "timestamp": 1792159374, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sushanthbobbylloyds", "author_id": "49140514481", "id": "18373448437210217", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c gods work", "timestamp": 1792084965, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "katazera99", "author_id": "51242727755", "id": "18145691632571800", "text": "And it looked great on CRTs back then.", "timestamp": 1791674105, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tom_fallon", "author_id": "180334552", "id": "18638766520024210", "text": "Right so glorified raycasting", "timestamp": 1791668068, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "richardm8422a", "author_id": "27540256623", "id": "18113731556334209", "text": "If that amazes you, wait until you find out about Rescue On Fractalus from the 1980s that had the same thing on an Atari 8 bit computer.", "timestamp": 1791658912, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "oobivat", "author_id": "57151314609", "id": "18107782700226974", "text": "I LOVED this game", "timestamp": 1791640812, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "bl0ckchan", "author_id": "75064921675", "id": "18100495625561104", "text": "Selling it for $7!", "timestamp": 1791604894, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "wmaltdel", "author_id": "1141845740", "id": "18112751588014689", "text": "There's a birtbike or quad racing game for the GBA that uses the same tech", "timestamp": 1791596961, "like_count": 4}, {"author": "yyc_tom", "author_id": "201749704", "id": "17874427734637989", "text": "Love your choice of content\u2026\nAwesome, awesome, awesome!", "timestamp": 1791595070, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "toutantjp", "author_id": "1427194976", "id": "17977105413068214", "text": "The best method ive seen in these older flightsim games was the use of modules to compose environements, Falcon 4 really crushed it", "timestamp": 1791587083, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "vaibhav94654", "author_id": "80453785845", "id": "18096426980674848", "text": "WE all miss novalogic", "timestamp": 1791584388, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeMiEoaP-8i/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeMiEoaP-8i/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeMiEoaP-8i", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/841928595_18003615015006966_7133040589589221442_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=NDAwMjcyNDAyMDY3NDg4MzM2Mg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=uJp7-CiquCIQ7kNvwHFPAcx&_nc_oc=Adrg4kzbsREvO3GGv_FN7cg9nZXmjGWP-cBbtbyKAIvUjcOuu_mx5-NY4S06-6SPyfE&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=hn5fH5YIbp2wC3V4a-xOAA&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQN2DEABaOmBYy39c-IleTewaey_RXGVxyTPmpG1xImfSw&oe=6AE61B25", "display_id": "DeMiEoaP-8i", "fulltitle": "Video by index.opensource", "upload_date": "20261007", "release_year": null, "requested_subtitles": null, "_has_drm": null, "epoch": 1793080898, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMyhhQTN8LrBj0EDygNjVFWpUjRWVK7yDl7Wz8pZ1IrLDigullZxDCFHFVElFc1pOvZ5FVQhGme1SOm2SROwljLFgI6PkPdpbUqjgs.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=CeQO-4aa77EQ7kNvwGSRe4E&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmV